# offtiler: makes an offset tile of an image it opens (File, open, a file dialog), the offset set by its Parameters menu. The package
# stages no image beside it, and with no image the parameters cannot be checked (they read the image's size), so the script reaches what
# needs none: the tile button answers its notice No subject image, Okay closes it, meta q quits. Left out: open, save, direction, factor.
click 1 29 46
wait
click 1 100 104
wait
move 100 120
keydown Alt_L
key q
keyup Alt_L
